# MSAL / Entra ID configuration (build.md §4). The Entra app registration
# is a prerequisite owned by the tenant admin (see
# docs/architecture/02-analysis/constraints-and-context.md C-2, C-3) — it
# must be type "Single-page application", not "Web".
#
# TWO redirect URIs must be registered on that SPA app registration:
#   1. VITE_MSAL_REDIRECT_URI below (app root) — used by the
#      loginRedirect() full-page fallback.
#   2. VITE_MSAL_REDIRECT_URI + "/auth-popup.html" — used by
#      loginPopup()/acquireTokenPopup(). This is a bare static page (see
#      public/auth-popup.html); MSAL's popup-closing logic needs it to
#      load near-instantly so it wins the race against React booting
#      inside the popup and closes the popup automatically.

